# `-emit wasm` — the JS/TS FACADE text: the `.mjs` loader and the `.d.ts` / `.d.mts` declarations,
# emitted segment by segment so the output is byte-identical to scripts/wasm_build.py's (the
# oracle in wasm_smoke.sh). Continues emit_wasm.elisa.


